			"notes": "<!-- Player-facing changes for One Kick 1.1.0. -->\n# 1.1.0-CHANGELOG\n\n# ADD\n\n+ Added Singularity, a treasure boot enchantment that lets fully charged kicks with Charge V, Overcharge II, and Disintegration erase any block, including bedrock.\n+ Added Afterburner, a rare boot enchantment that burns kicked creatures, leaves flame and smoke trails, ignites nearby ground during low flight, and adds fire to Unstable Collision explosions.\n+ Added the Override challenge for erasing a bedrock block.\n+ Added the Trailblazer advancement for igniting over 100 blocks in a single kick."
		},
