			"notes": "<!-- Player-facing changes for the shared 1.0.0 release. -->\n# 1.0.0-CHANGELOG\n\n# FIX\n\n+ Disintegration and Kinetic Overload destruction now stop at unbreakable and kick-immune blocks instead of punching through them.\n+ The One-Kick Hero advancement now counts health actually lost from a kick, so damage reduction no longer inflates the total."
